<section xml:id="_anchors_and_formatting">
<title>Anchors and Formatting</title>
<simpara><anchor xml:id="inline-anchor" xreflabel="[inline-anchor]"/>Anchored text, <anchor xml:id="another" xreflabel="Ref text"/> and <anchor xml:id="phrase-id"/><emphasis role="strong"><phrase role="role1 role2">styled phrase</phrase></emphasis>.
<emphasis role="strong">strong</emphasis> <emphasis>emphasis</emphasis> <literal>mono</literal> <emphasis role="marked">highlight</emphasis> <superscript>super</superscript> <subscript>sub</subscript> <emphasis role="strong">un</emphasis>constrained <emphasis>emp</emphasis>hasis <literal>mo</literal>no <emphasis role="marked">ma</emphasis>rk.
<phrase role="underline">underlined</phrase> <phrase role="line-through">struck</phrase> <phrase role="big">big</phrase> <phrase role="small">small</phrase>.
<quote role="double">double curved</quote> <quote role="single">single curved</quote> it&#8217;s &#169; &#174; &#8482;&#8201;&#8212;&#8201;&#8230;&#8203; &#8594; &#8658; &#8592; &#8656; &#169; &amp; &#x2122;.</simpara>
</section>
<section xml:id="_stem">
<title>STEM</title>
<simpara>Inline <inlineequation><alt><![CDATA[\sqrt{x^2+1}]]></alt><mathphrase><![CDATA[\sqrt{x^2+1}]]></mathphrase></inlineequation> and <inlineequation><alt><![CDATA[E=mc^2]]></alt><mathphrase><![CDATA[E=mc^2]]></mathphrase></inlineequation> and <inlineequation><mathphrase><![CDATA[sum_(i=1)^n i]]></mathphrase></inlineequation>.</simpara>
<informalequation>
<alt><![CDATA[\int_0^\infty e^{-x} \, dx = 1]]></alt>
<mathphrase><![CDATA[\int_0^\infty e^{-x} \, dx = 1]]></mathphrase>
</informalequation>
</section>
